Dear {{landlord}},

I moved in to {{address}} on {{move_in}}. Attached is my move-in record: {{photo_count}} dated photos of {{room_count}} rooms.

{{meter_lines}}

Each photo shows the date, time and place it was taken, and a SHA-256 fingerprint of the file. The fingerprint shows the photos have not been changed since.

Please keep this with the check-in inventory. If you disagree with anything in it, please tell me in writing within 7 days.

Could you also confirm which scheme protects my deposit of {{deposit}}, and send the prescribed information if you haven't already?

Thank you,
{{name}}
{{today}}

