{{name}}
{{today}}

templates.dispute_response:
Dear {{landlord}},

Deposit for {{address}}
Tenancy: {{move_in}} to {{move_out}}
Deposit: {{deposit}}, protected with {{scheme}}

You have proposed keeping {{claim}} for: {{reasons}}

I don't agree. On {{sent_date}} I sent you dated, fingerprinted photos of the property on move-in day. My move-out photos, taken on {{move_out}}, show the same rooms. Side by side they show {{comparison}}.

Landlords shouldn't charge for fair wear and tear. Any charge should match the actual loss, and take into account the age of the item and how long I lived there.

Please return my deposit in full. If we can't agree, I will ask {{scheme}} to use its free dispute service, and send them my evidence pack.

Yours sincerely,
{{name}}
{{today}}
